      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEKTRA HARMONY (4) settled down midfield and held her position to the line when finishing 5th (22.70) at this track. Comes through a solid form race last start. Can discover winning form. MISS COCO (8) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 2.25 lengths at Traralgon in a handy 20.15 beating Jumbuk Johnny. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to her name from eight starts. Should feature again. BUSH JEWEL (1) has missed the frame the last couple but was a Grade 5 winner three back (22.57) at this track over 390m. Can improve sharply here. PAW QATAR (2) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
